393 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Hey \173First\137Name\175\054\n\nWe just wrapped a beta launch of our gamified LMS with 56\054000 learners\054 and the results were eye\055opening\072\n\nStudy time shot up 25\0566\045\nCourse completions jumped 19\045\nSessions per learner climbed 13\045\n\nAnd here\031s the best part\072\nNo extra work for L\046D\056\nNo forced motivation\056\nJust real\054 sustained engagement\056\n\n\050If you\031d like more details\054 the full report is attached\051\n\n\nBut numbers only tell half the story\056 Real magic is in the stories of the teams handling learning\054 like yours\056\n\nSo presenting \034The 2025 Challenge\035\n\nTell us your team\031s learning success story with Alison\031s LMS this year \0502025 so far\051 at \133Company\137Name\135\056 Big or small\054 maybe it\031s a milestone your team achieved\054 a shift in learner engagement\054 or even a breakthrough moment that made you proud\056\n\n\nWhat\031s in it for you\077 \nWe\031ll reward the two best stories\056\n1st Prize\072 A full annual Growth Plan subscription \050\0442\054100 value\051\n2nd Prize\072 \044500 worth of Alison Certificates\nPlus\072 We\031ll feature the winning stories to inspire our global L\046D community\056\n\n\nHow to Play\072\nSubmit your story \133via this form\135\056\nMake sure you\031re following us on )
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 396 0 R
     /Pg 377 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
